   "notes": "Source-reported 300 K isotherm, preserved without substituting refit coefficients. Natural high-spin R-3c Fe0.95Mn0.05CO3, not pure FeCO3. Pressure is retained on the printed Au scale; its exact realization is unresolved. The high-temperature candidate is withheld because Table 1 and the abstract disagree on a0. All printed cold rows give pressure RMSE 0.230 GPa with published coefficients; the manuscript 0.11-0.17 GPa RMS range is not recovered. Source objective, weights, parameter covariance and confidence convention are not specified. No extension across the cited spin transition near 45 GPa or a numerical decomposition boundary is claimed."
