   "notes": "Explicit opt-in Peritheos joint thermal refit, not either parameter set published by Litasov et al. All five coefficients were fitted together; V0=293.4 A^3 and Tr=300 K remain fixed. alpha0 is the absolute-temperature intercept. The observed pressure RMSE is 0.22121 GPa. The full conditional covariance is supplied; standard errors omit fixed-reference-volume uncertainty and pressure-scale systematics. The original 300 K EOS remains the default. Use within the measured paths; extrema do not guarantee phase stability throughout a rectangle. The source discusses redox-sensitive decomposition and a spin transition near 45 GPa outside these measurements. Both conflicting published thermal sets are non-executable under source.thermal_parameterizations."
  }
